\\\\  & =-(1)+2 \\\\  & =-1+2 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the second point is $(1,1).$\n\nFinally, we plot those two points on the $xy$-plane and draw a line through them. This is the graph of $y=-x+2.$\n\n![](images/a7/a7adc391484a7a183400fff460abfb7ae39494ba19e934303474c1165633b60e.png)\n\nAll choices have the same $y$-intercept. Check another point to distinguish the lines."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186703097 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3c0325ae-6de9-5011-aaa3-5579675de727" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/6b/6b894d066e6e8808a874a6798772247aec34012afb997ccda34c30e5a46abad6.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703069} {:answer/id #uuid "53f46dff-2a55-53ad-aa14-0c03e4a58845" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c8/c891b97111decfd2e2d58623cc24db4174d794f012de4f00c59d017b28fa265b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703073} {:answer/id #uuid "5551dd02-cee3-5419-bfa0-4df6a3e8c2cf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/71/717afcde0b8ded7f6c94197b87de4901525d9b34f6106852806f82b8da64a765.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703074} {:answer/id #uuid "c73c2d63-8095-5ce8-b0c6-17a369e6b29d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/50/501a7d9f43ee0727cdb2dd6b9ce3fd75c0814fda92e56d88c7f621b770b07192.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703092} {:answer/id #uuid "f00cd8e4-3a64-5a05-be6d-6fd5d734435a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/1c/1c38f92ee450a08555763715b866d8d757f24329d8b173c412f1e28c93248c42.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186703099}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5551dd02-cee3-5419-bfa0-4df6a3e8c2cf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/71/717afcde0b8ded7f6c94197b87de4901525d9b34f6106852806